@startuml
!include _seq.iuml
title Sequência - Backup e Sair (UC26, UC03)
actor Usuário as U
participant "Tela (app.js)" as T
participant Servidor as S
participant Conexao as C
database SQLite as DB
== Backup ==
U -> T : clicar em "Backup"
T -> S : POST /api/backup
S -> C : backup()
C -> DB : VACUUM INTO 'backup/confeitasys-AAAAMMDD-HHMMSS.db'
S --> T : {arquivo}
T --> U : "Backup salvo em ..."
== Sair ==
U -> T : clicar em "Sair"
T -> S : POST /api/logout
S -> S : remover sessão + apagar cookie
S --> T : 200 {ok}
T --> U : tela de login
@enduml
